---
title: Voice call · rejoin the running call or set up a new private Daily room
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant tab as Session tab · Pipecat client
  participant api as FastAPI · Supabase Compute
  participant daily as Daily
  participant agent as Pipecat Cloud · voice agent

  tab->>api: POST /v1/sessions/{session_id}/voice/connections
  Note over api: Authorize the originating user<br/>and the current Interview Session.
  alt call's agent still running and its room has 15+ minutes left
    api->>daily: eject the participant's browser still in the room
    api-->>tab: new participant token · same room, connection ID, voice_run_id
  else no call to rejoin
    Note over api: Supersede any open connection.<br/>Commit the new connection row.
    api->>daily: create a private room for the connection
    daily-->>api: room URL + meeting tokens
    Note over api: Bind the room · queue the interview.voice_agent Job
    api->>agent: start a session for the Job
    opt the session cannot start
      Note over api: Close the connection, so a retry opens a new call<br/>rather than rejoining one no agent is coming to.
    end
    api-->>tab: room URL, participant token, connection ID, voice_run_id
    agent->>daily: claim the Job · join with the owner token
  end
  tab->>daily: join · WebRTC audio + RTVI events
